      "published_at": "2026-10-11T05:11:23Z",
      "title": "Joe Mazzulla on Jayson Tatum’s performance in the Celtics’ preseason win over the Sixers:",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/bobbykrivitsky.bsky.social/post/3mxlaihmrsk2e",
      "author": "Bobby Krivitsky",
      "thumbnail": "https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Adnxkqc6rsqossh7uhyobkeua/bafkreiegodzctohb65of6vrhuula5jj57ukwdsr4zjtxdf5r7qiluo7ze4/thumbnail.jpg",
      "body_excerpt": "Joe Mazzulla on Jayson Tatum’s performance in the Celtics’ preseason win over the Sixers:\n\n“The ball found him, but he was able to create opportunities for him and his teammates.“\n\n“I thought cardio looked good, decision making looked good, and activity was good.”",
