        "author": "Bobby Krivitsky",
        "handle": "bobbykrivitsky.bsky.social",
        "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:dnxkqc6rsqossh7uhyobkeua/bafkreico5zyufbnodb5nzc2crnx7rm453722niv7tsvca3u2mrjotqiasq",
        "text": "Jayson Tatum on how it felt to be back out there feeling like his normal self:\n\nHe had 23 points, 5 rebounds, 4 assists, and 1 steal:\n\n“Just to be back in the normal flow of the season and going through the normal reps. I was really happy to kind of just be a part of it today. Kind of feel normal.”",
